{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303062","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303062","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430306201:1":{"text":"셀로클랜드가 더 나아지는 것을 모든 에세일들이 바라고 있으니까!","source_cn":"因为所有艾塞勒都在期待萨洛克兰变得更好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x074A6E6194161452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430306202:1":{"text":"맞아. 이곳의 모든 의식은 정화야. 셀로클랜드의 죄악을 깨끗하게 씻어내는 정화.","source_cn":"没错，这里的每场仪式都是一次清洗，萨洛克兰中的罪孽终将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3905DAD137C4331F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430306203:1":{"text":"정화를 지켜보는 것만으로도 나의 마음이 정화되고 여왕님에 대한 존경심이 더욱 깊어지지.","source_cn":"每次围观清洗也会净化我的心灵，令我对女王的尊崇愈发虔诚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC71957E564429C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族莫瑞":{"text":"귀족 모레이","source":"贵族莫瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族凯尔顿":{"text":"귀족 칼튼","source":"贵族凯尔顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}